          "path": "_m/g/f/q/0/findlater-castle-wp/findlater-castle-viewpoint-geo.jpg",
          "filename": "Findlater Castle Viewpoint - geograph.org.uk - 1761475.jpg",
          "caption": "Findlater Castle Viewpoint THe circular wall contains an interpretative board which briefly tells the history of the castle below. \nI was very glad of its existence today. Notice the sea surface, which is whipped up into a mass of white horses. The gales today were such that I was barely able to stand on the clifftop, and instantly abandoned as foolhardy my original plan of descending to the castle itself, and contented myself with viewing the ruins from the comparative shelter and safety of the viewpoint.",
          "alt": "Findlater Castle Viewpoint THe circular wall contains an interpretative board which briefly tells the history of the castle below. \nI was very glad of its existence today. Notice the sea surface, which is whipped up into a mass of white horses. The gales today were such that I was barely able to stand on the clifftop, and instantly abandoned as foolhardy my original plan of descending to the castle itself, and contented myself with viewing the ruins from the comparative shelter and safety of the viewpoint.",
