          "filename": "Waymark and Viewpoint - geograph.org.uk - 1761487.jpg",
          "caption": "Waymark and Viewpoint. The waymark points right towards Sandend, and left to Sunnyside Beach on the way to Cullen. To the right is 1761475.\nNotice the sea surface, which is whipped up into a mass of white horses. The gales today were such that I was barely able to stand on the clifftop, and instantly abandoned as foolhardy my original plan of descending to the castle itself. There was so much sea spray that there were shifting rainbows all over the surface of the sea.",
          "alt": "Waymark and Viewpoint. The waymark points right towards Sandend, and left to Sunnyside Beach on the way to Cullen. To the right is 1761475.\nNotice the sea surface, which is whipped up into a mass of white horses. The gales today were such that I was barely able to stand on the clifftop, and instantly abandoned as foolhardy my original plan of descending to the castle itself. There was so much sea spray that there were shifting rainbows all over the surface of the sea.",
